            <title>[MAHOUT-434] LuceneIterable doesn&apos;t preserve the vector as a namedvector after normalization</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/MAHOUT-434</link>
                <project id="12310751" key="MAHOUT">Mahout</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Per &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.lucidimagination.com/search/document/713e7c8349727a29/reading_vectors_created_from_a_lucene_index#90f94a8d5bc78610&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;http://www.lucidimagination.com/search/document/713e7c8349727a29/reading_vectors_created_from_a_lucene_index#90f94a8d5bc78610&lt;/a&gt;, need to preserve NamedVector when normalizing&lt;/p&gt;</description>
