                            <comment id="12885303" author="gsingers" created="Mon, 5 Jul 2010 19:05:19 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Actually, NamedVector.normalize probably shouldn&apos;t preserve it, but LuceneIterable should.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="12885310" author="gsingers" created="Mon, 5 Jul 2010 19:28:19 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;LuceneIterable preserves NamedVector now.  Added a test and committed.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
